  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary Scaffolding Flow",
      "items": [
        "SeedCli parses --refresh (-r) and --path (-p), then launches WizardRunner (exit 0 on success, 130 on EOF cancel, 1 on error).",
        "WizardRunner steps through project type, language, Spring Boot version (hiding unstable SNAPSHOT/M versions for Gradle), dependencies, metadata, packaging, Java version, and output directory.",
        "FuzzyMatcher scores dependencies by exact ID (100), prefix (80), substring (60/50), token prefix (40), description (20), and Levenshtein distance <= 2 (10)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "External Dependencies & Resilience",
      "items": [
        "Spring Initializr (https://start.spring.io): MetadataService calls /metadata/client (15s timeout) and ProjectGeneratorService calls /starter.zip (30s timeout) via Java HttpClient.",
        "Local Cache (~/.cache/seed/metadata.json): validated for required select groups and defaults; reused for 1 hour or as a fallback if network refresh fails.",
        "System Git CLI: GitInitializer spawns git init, git add ., and git commit -m 'Initial commit' via ProcessBuilder after .gitignore is updated."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Ownership & Trust Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Untrusted Network Input: MetadataService validates all select groups and default IDs before caching; ProjectGeneratorService normalizes paths and blocks Zip-slip traversal (!resolved.startsWith(canonicalTarget)).",
        "Overwrite & Path Safety: WizardRunner rejects artifactIds containing '/', '\\\\', '.', or '..'; ProjectGeneratorService refuses to extract into any non-empty target directory.",
        "Secret & Config Hygiene: EnvFileWriter never overwrites an existing .env, appends /.env to .gitignore before Git commit, and migrates application.properties entries to quoted YAML."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Build & Native Runtime",
      "items": [
        "Targets Java 25 with Picocli 4.7.6, Jackson 2.20.2, and Jansi 2.4.2; packaged as a shaded fat JAR or GraalVM native binary (mvn -Pnative).",
        "GraalVM reflection metadata (META-INF/native-image/reflect-config.json) registers InitializrMetadata, ProjectType, Option, DependencyGroup, and Dependency models.",
        "Post-extraction POM fix strips legacy .RELEASE suffixes from Spring Boot versions in generated pom.xml files."
      ]
    }
  ]
